# --- Rust ---
/target
# Cargo.lock should be tracked for binary projects
# Only ignore lock file if it's a library, but this looks like an app. 
# Usually for apps we keep it, but some prefer to ignore it. 
# I'll leave it tracked for now unless the user asks, but I'll add common backup files.
**/*.rs.bk
**/*.pdb

